Moria Supreme builds on Linux and macOS with CMake and ncurses, and in a
browser with Emscripten. See README.md.

The old instructions told you to copy an operating-system directory
(DOS, Atari ST, Amiga, Mac Classic, or VMS) in with the sources and to
install the game setuid. Those ports are not in this tree, and the score
file is per-user under $HOME/.moriasupreme, so the game is not setuid.

    cmake -S . -B build
    cmake --build build
    ./build/moriasupreme

The browser site is produced by web/build.sh. It is a static folder.
Wilson's copyright and Koeneke's no-sale dedication are unchanged.
